%% Title: Pricing v2, from one curve input to a fair value, a ladder and a quote (1.2.0, opt-in)
flowchart TD
  feed["CurveFeedV2, one round every 500 ms<br/>overnight fixing, SR1 x2, SR3 x3,<br/>par swaps at 8 tenors"]
  ring["Inbound ring, journal, dispatch<br/>optional conflation: newest value per key,<br/>journaled when dispatched"]
  handler["DeskGroup.onCurveInput<br/>kinds Fixing, Future, ParSwap"]
  band{"PricingV2: within 100 bp<br/>of the previous value?"}
  reject["Dropped, counted in rejectedInputs"]
  hold["Held in the round"]
  trigger{"Round complete, or 100 ms<br/>since its first input?"}
  timer["Housekeeping timer, 10 ms<br/>advanceTo(journaled time):<br/>applies a timed-out round once,<br/>moves the date at the 17:00 New York cut"]
  curve{"SofrCurve.update solves?"}
  keep["Last good curve and quotes kept,<br/>counted in rejectedInputs"]
  loo["SofrLeaveOneOut<br/>a pillar swap's value without its own quote"]
  smooth["FairValueSmoother<br/>residual, 5 minute half-life"]
  book["LoopBook<br/>composite Treasury and futures books"]
  fit["TreasurySpreadCurve<br/>z-spread of a bond fitted to the others"]
  bond["Bond fair value<br/>fitted spread plus smoothed residual"]
  swap["Swap fair value"]
  fut["FuturesOverlay<br/>TY: its book mid, declared sensitivity"]
  ladder["Rate ladder on 8 tenors<br/>curve Jacobian, bonds at market z-spread"]
  spread["SpreadRiskBook<br/>displayed only: no limit, no hedge"]
  after["DeskGroup.afterReprice<br/>RiskEngine.onCurveMove, onFairValue"]
  use["Quoting engine, risk checks, hedger"]

  feed --> ring --> handler --> band
  band -->|no| reject
  band -->|yes| hold --> trigger
  trigger -->|no, wait| hold
  timer -.-> trigger
  trigger -->|yes| curve
  curve -->|no| keep
  curve -->|yes| loo
  keep -->|values recomputed off it| loo
  loo --> smooth --> swap
  curve -->|yes| fit
  book --> fit --> bond
  book --> fut
  swap --> ladder
  bond --> ladder
  ladder --> after
  fut --> after
  after --> spread
  after --> use
